Robochem-Flex is a low-cost, modular self-driving laboratory platform 
designed to democratize autonomous chemical experimentation.
The system combines customizable, in-house-built hardware with a flexible
Python-based software framework that integrates real-time device control 
and advanced Bayesian optimization strategies, including multi-objective
and transfer learning workflows. 

